# Primary CTA

Single source: `site/src/styles/cta-tokens.css` (loaded last) +
`.film-cta` / `.send-button` in `film-identity.css`.

Tokens: `--cta-bg: #001956` · `--cta-fg: #ffffff` · `--cta-secondary-bg: #e77855`.

## Rule

- Primary actions are **navy filled buttons** (`#001956`, white label), hover invert to outline in the same navy.
- Use class `film-cta` or `send-button` (aliases already wired for home paths, project CTA, awards toggle).
- Do **not** redefine `--cta-bg` in `index.css`, `theme-light.css`, or `archive-design.css`.
- Do **not** use underline text / ghost text links as primary CTAs.

## Exceptions

- Secondary (`.film-cta--secondary`): coral `#e77855` (e.g. Meet the founder).
- Cookie / legal chrome may differ.
